{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"No","category":"储能","country":"英国","country_iso":"GBR","created_at":"2026-03-23T09:39:07.598282","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"GBR-ES-0003","ldc":"No","location":"","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"英国280MWh电网级储能项目","project_name_en":"UK 280MWh Grid-Scale Battery Energy Storage Project","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"晶科储能","content":"晶科储能近日宣布进一步扩大其在英国的项目布局，新增加一套140MWh的电网级储能系统。首期的140MWh项目正在交付过程中，两期项目合计容量达到280MWh，成为英国规模最大的电池储能项目之一。两期项目均将采用晶科储能最先进的Utility G2 5MWh液冷集装箱储能系统。\n晶科储能的Utility G2系统专为应对英国多变的气候而设计。依托先进的液冷技术，系统能将\n电芯温差精准控制在±2.5℃\n，即使在零下10℃的低温环境中，仍\n维持超过94%的RTE效率\n。同时，其\n具备IP55防护等级\n，可应对雨雪天气，并搭载\n智能云管理平台\n，以实现更高效的电网调节与运行优化。\n“这项长期合作体现了市场对我们技术的深度信任，”晶科储能欧洲区总经理Roberto Murgioni表示。“G2系统以其稳定、高效与安全的表现，为英国蓬勃发展的储能市场提供了必要的技术支撑。”","content_sha256":"8d2a84a8540027e004efe7a3e03a3d6750cd26b7a145fe3b0457100b6aa1dea9","id":913,"publish_date":"2025-12-05 23:23:01","title":"晶科储能以280MWh电网级项目加速布局英国储能市场","title_sha256":"8e25e63e8838bac485eaa2568168173ceb6d54c9501fac1114e68bbcf99e3ed9","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/90708.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"GBR-ES-0003","capacity_details":"BESS: 280MW","capacity_mw":280.0,"capacity_mw_raw":"280","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T09:39:07.598310","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"GBR-ES-0003-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[\"https://www.powerchina.cn/\"]","official_website_links":"[]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"晶科储能科技有限公司","project_developer_en":"Jinko ESS","project_stage":"在建","project_summary":"晶科储能公司在英国部署了